---

<section class="bridge">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="/about-fediverse" class="card">
      <div class="text">
        <span class="eyebrow">인스턴스? ActivityPub? 진짜 이름이 궁금하다면</span>
        <h3>
          여기서 <b>동네</b>라고 부른 건 <b>인스턴스</b>, <br />
          <b>같은 약속</b>이라고 한 건 <b>ActivityPub</b>예요.
        </h3>
        <p>이게 어떤 구조로 이어지는지, 정식 용어로 한 곳에 정리해 뒀어요.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="cta">정식 용어로 알기 <span class="arr">→</span></span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bridge {
    padding: 24px 0 8px;
  }
  .bridge .card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    transition:
      transform 0.2s,
      border-color 0.2s,
      box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .bridge .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--line-2);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -32px rgba(15, 21, 18, 0.18);
  }
  .bridge .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .bridge h3 {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2.1vw, 22px);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .bridge h3 b {
    font-weight: 700;
    background: var(--mint-soft);
    padding: 0 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .bridge p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .bridge .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .bridge .card:hover .arr {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .bridge .arr {
    transition: transform 0.15s;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .bridge .card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 22px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
